    "detailed_description": "Ever wonder what would happen if James Cameron set the bar just a little too low and then dared us to jump over it? Well, buckle up! \u2018Horror at the Harpers\u2019 is our first ever game, crafted with the same precision and care that a toddler uses to build a sandcastle during high tide.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStep into the haunting world of &quot;Horror at the Harpers,&quot; where a father's desperate search for his missing daughter unravels a terrifying mystery. Tony Harper's life changed forever when his beloved daughter, Ellie, vanished without a trace. Left with nothing but the haunting echoes of her voice, Tony embarks on a journey into the paranormal, determined to uncover the truth behind her disappearance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs Tony delves deeper into the spirit world, he discovers an unsettling connection with Ellie, but his quest to reunite with her leads him into the clutches of something far darker. Unbeknownst to Tony, his efforts to communicate with his lost daughter awaken a malevolent force, a demonic entity that feeds on fear and despair.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you be able to guide Tony through this nightmarish ordeal and help him find Ellie, or will you succumb to the darkness that threatens to consume him? &quot;Horror at the Harpers&quot; is a gripping horror experience that will test your nerves and keep you on the edge of your seat. Enter if you dare, but beware \u2013 the Harper household holds more than just memories; it harbors a darkness that refuses to let go.",
    "about_the_game": "Ever wonder what would happen if James Cameron set the bar just a little too low and then dared us to jump over it? Well, buckle up! \u2018Horror at the Harpers\u2019 is our first ever game, crafted with the same precision and care that a toddler uses to build a sandcastle during high tide.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStep into the haunting world of &quot;Horror at the Harpers,&quot; where a father's desperate search for his missing daughter unravels a terrifying mystery. Tony Harper's life changed forever when his beloved daughter, Ellie, vanished without a trace. Left with nothing but the haunting echoes of her voice, Tony embarks on a journey into the paranormal, determined to uncover the truth behind her disappearance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs Tony delves deeper into the spirit world, he discovers an unsettling connection with Ellie, but his quest to reunite with her leads him into the clutches of something far darker. Unbeknownst to Tony, his efforts to communicate with his lost daughter awaken a malevolent force, a demonic entity that feeds on fear and despair.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you be able to guide Tony through this nightmarish ordeal and help him find Ellie, or will you succumb to the darkness that threatens to consume him? &quot;Horror at the Harpers&quot; is a gripping horror experience that will test your nerves and keep you on the edge of your seat. Enter if you dare, but beware \u2013 the Harper household holds more than just memories; it harbors a darkness that refuses to let go.",
